{"results":[{"url":"https://unicourt.com/courts/federal","final_url":"https://unicourt.com/courts/federal","title":"Federal Court Records | PACER Case Search - UniCourt","description":"Search federal court records online from U.S. appellate, circuit, district, bankruptcy courts, and the PACER Case Locator for free. Lookup federal court cases by name, case number, party, attorney, judge, case type, docket entry & more.","language":"en","text":"# Public Access to Federal Court Records\n\nSearch online public court records from U.S. federal courts and the PACER Case Locator for free. UniCourt allows you to access federal court records online from appellate, circuit, district, bankruptcy courts, and PACER. With UniCourt, you can look up federal court cases, find latest docket information, view case summary, check case status, download court documents, as well as track cases and get alerts on new filings.\n\nAt UniCourt, you can look up PACER court records by case name, case number, party, attorney, judge, case type, docket entry & more. You can filter search results further by date of filing, jurisdiction, case type, party type, party representation, and more.\n\n21M+\n\nFederal Cases\n\n80M+\n\nCourt Documents\n\n84M+\n\nDocket Entries\n\n## Featured Cases in Federal Courts\n\nLast updated on 5th November 2026, at 15:30 (UTC)\n\nActivision Publishing, Inc. v. Ryan Rothholz et al\n\nU.S. District Courts |\nCalifornia Central District |\nIntellectual Property - Copyright |\n2:25-cv-04075 | 05/07/2025\n\n* DOCKET\n\n* 10/29/2026\n\n* (#153) PROOF OF SERVICE FILED BY PLAINTIFF ACTIVISION PUBLISHING, INC., SERVED ON 10/27/2026. (SHEPHERD, HANNAH) (ENTERED: 10/29/2026)\n\n  [+] Read More\n  [-] Read Less\n\n* DOCKET\n\n* 10/22/2026\n\n* (#152) PROOF OF SERVICE FILED BY DEFENDANT RYAN ROTHHOLZ, RE DECLARATION (MOTION RELATED) #151 , MOTION TO DISMISS CASE #150 SERVED ON 10/21/2026. (IV) (ENTERED: 10/29/2026)\n\n  [+] Read More\n  [-] Read Less\n\nUBANK v. FORENSIC STAT LABORA